PROGRAM:QUADCPLX
Lbl ST
ClrHome
Disp "AX^2+BX+C=0"
Input "A=",A
If A=0
Goto ST
Input "B=",B
Input "C=",C
B^2-4*A*C→D
If D=0
Goto RPT
If D>0
Goto TWOREAL
Goto CPLX
Lbl RPT
ClrHome
Disp "RAIZ DOBLE"
-B/(2*A)→X
Disp "X=",X
Pause
Goto ST
Lbl TWOREAL
ClrHome
Disp "DOS RAICES REALES"
(-B+√(D))/(2*A)→X
(-B-√(D))/(2*A)→Y
Disp "X1=",X
Disp "X2=",Y
Pause
Goto ST
Lbl CPLX
ClrHome
Disp "RAICES COMPLEJAS"
-B/(2*A)→P
√(-D)/(2*A)→Q
Disp "PARTE REAL=",P
Disp "PARTE IMAG=",Q
Disp "X1=P+Qi  X2=P-Qi"
Pause
Goto ST